= December 2025 — Consolidation or renewal

[? if advisor_reshuffle_removed_czarzasty = 0 and barons_active = 1: The
post-merger congress can retain Czarzasty, set a date for succession, or open
the leadership to a membership vote.?]
[? if advisor_reshuffle_removed_czarzasty = 1 or barons_active = 0: Czarzasty
was removed from the party's leadership centre earlier. The congress therefore
chooses between a labour-progressive transition and an open primary; it does
not silently restore him.?]

- @leader_czarzasty
- @leader_transition
- @leader_primary

@leader_czarzasty
title: Consolidate behind Czarzasty through 2027
subtitle: Keep the old organisational centre through the election and postpone renewal.
view-if: advisor_reshuffle_removed_czarzasty = 0 and barons_active = 1
on-arrival: left_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"; left_leadership_result = "Czarzasty elected sole chair through the 2027 election"; barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 6; spring_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 4; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "The old organisational centre keeps control of New Left through the election cycle"

Czarzasty converts the merger into one chair and carries the old regional
machine toward 2027. His wing closes ranks; Wiosna and the progressive current
hear that generational renewal has been postponed again.

- @poland_event_queue: Record Czarzasty's sole chair

@leader_transition
title: Elect [+ left_transition_nominee +] as sole chair
subtitle: Make a generational handover and ask the old machine to serve a new centre.
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_leader = Q.left_transition_nominee;
Q.left_leadership_result =
    Q.left_transition_nominee + " elected in the generational handover";
Q.labor_strength += 3;
Q.labor_credibility += 2;
Q.union_trust += 1;
Q.progressives_strength += 3;
Q.barons_dissent += 4;
Q.party_unity += 3;
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.news_headline = Q.left_transition_nominee +
    " wins the sole-chair vote";
!}

**[+ left_transition_nominee +]** takes the sole chair with labour and
progressive support. The public sees a handover; Czarzasty's organisers remain
inside the party, but no longer control its centre by right.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the generational handover

@leader_primary
